# Global Financial Services Performance & What-If Dashboard (Power BI)

An interactive 2-page **Power BI** dashboard analyzing revenue, billable hours, average hourly rates, client counts, service line performance, and What-If projections across global regions and departments.

## 🎥 Video Walkthrough
Watch the demo video here: [Watch Video](https://youtu.be/kVfhKH-v72c)

---

## 📌 Dashboard Sections & Key Features

### 1. Performance Overview (`Analysis`)
- **KPIs:** Total Revenue (`195M`), Total Hours (`217K`), Average Hourly Rate (`901.00`), and Total Clients (`4K`).
- **Visuals & Slicers:** Revenue by Department (`Audit`, `Management`, `Advisory`, `Tax`, `Legal`), Revenue by Region (`Europe`, `Americas`, `EMEA`, `APAC`), and monthly revenue trend, filtered by Country, Department, and Region.

### 2. Service Lines & Scenario Modeling (`What if ?`)
- **KPIs & Gauge:** Expected Profit (`4bn`), Total Services (`48K`), and Revenue Progress (`195M` against `391M`).
- **Visuals & Parameters:** Revenue by `SERVICE_DESCRIPTION` (`Annual Tax Filing`, `Strategy Consulting`, `Legal Consultation`, `Market Analysis`, `Quarterly Review`), interactive What-If parameter slider, and monthly actual vs. projected revenue comparison.

